                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Worth the money. The dev is very active so far and listening to player feedback. No single player in this one, which for VR is kinda a bummer unless the game can attract a steady VR player base like Onward, which is no easy feat. There are currently a few big negatives for the release build I'm playing. \n\nFirst is no in game comms. For a squad based game like this, I would have really hoped to have it on release.\nSecond is the game takes place in the middle of your playspace, there is no way to center the game to where you want to sit. I sit on a couch outside of my playspace, so I ended up kneeling in the middle of my space to play. This was fixed the day after release. There is now a center to sitting location option.\n\nSome positives too:\nSquad based tank battles are fun\nThere is a discord to join for voice comms\nThe dev is also on comms playing with you\nThe controls are tough at first but they are fun and take time to master\nPrice is right\n\nOverall I recommend this game. It's good enough so far and the dev is active and listening to suggestions. Once the two main points above are addressed, the game will be really fun.",
